      "key": "P00",
      "findings": "@randomdude7551, TikTok brand-video comment, 5-15, 296 displayed likes: calls metal packaging chic and environmentally friendly. Aesthetic approval and endorsed environmental assertion; no verified environmental assessment, purchase consequence or explicit SKU/version. Same actor as P03."
    },
    {
      "key": "P01",
      "findings": "@experimentwrld, brand/creator reply to P00, 5-15, 39 likes: agrees fully with praise. Owned endorsement, not independent customer experience or proof of recyclability; same brand actor as P07."
    },
    {
      "key": "P02",
      "findings": "@person1234567556987, reply to P00, 5-15, 0 likes: questions environmental friendliness and recyclability. Preserves uncertainty; does not demonstrate that packaging is unrecyclable."
    },
    {
      "key": "P03",
      "findings": "@randomdude7551, reply under P00, 5-15, 2 likes: says aluminum is almost always recyclable, inner part likely recyclable, pump likely not, and pump/shell reusable. Speculative component claims; same origin as P00, not added independent corroboration."
    },
    {
      "key": "P04",
      "findings": "@flamingpanda5, reply under P00, 5-20, 0 likes: requests refill bundles. Product unspecified; assortment preference, not completed buying or repurchase."
    },
    {
      "key": "P06",
      "findings": "@jasminesingh1102, TikTok root complaint, 5-15, 12 likes: product arrived leaked with loose top; opened and cleaned it, then asked whether oxygen exposure made it unusable. SKU/version unknown. Explicit arrival leak and loose top; no demonstrated spoilage or customer remedy completion."
    },
    {
      "key": "P07",
      "findings": "@experimentwrld, brand reply to P06, 5-16, 12 likes: says short-term exposure is not an issue and offers to send a replacement after contact at hey@experimentbeauty.com. Offer and brand reassurance only; no confirmed dispatch/delivery or independent safety finding."
    },
    {
      "key": "P15",
      "findings": "@bmdubs, 5-15, 150 likes: plans to use an empty package to hold Lexapro. Intended reuse with substantial visible endorsement, not demonstrated reuse or evidence of suitability; SKU unknown."
    },
    {
      "key": "P17",
      "findings": "@mostlyconceptual, 5-16, 1 like: reports unusual-for-them brand loyalty, an all-Experiment skincare routine and Continuum in the mail. Explicit current use and shipment statement; no packaging-attributed loyalty or confirmed delivery."
    },
    {
      "key": "P20",
      "findings": "@countryboiiloveyouuuxoxo, 5-15, 7 likes: says they are buying everything from the brand. Broad buying expression; no itemized completed checkout, repeat purchase or explicit packaging motivation."
    },
