    },
    {
      "key": "P08",
      "findings": "@savi.glow, reply to P06, 5-16, 5 likes: says the same happened to theirs, ordered from Sephora, which sent a free replacement. Context supports arrival-leak agreement plus narrated remedy dispatch; no explicit loose-top detail or confirmed replacement delivery. SKU unknown."
    },
    {
      "key": "P09",
      "findings": "@user851526p, reply to P06, 5-16, 4 likes: terse 'sadly same' supports contextual arrival-leak agreement. No independent detail about closure, SKU, severity or remedy."
    },
    {
      "key": "P10",
      "findings": "@lara_jlue, reply to P06, 5-16, 4 likes: says theirs came the same way. Bare contextual arrival agreement; no explicit loose-top description, SKU or consequence."
    },
    {
      "key": "P11",
      "findings": "@bert181818, reply to P06, 5-16, 2 likes: bare same agreement. Counted as contextual arrival-leak agreement, not a detailed mechanical diagnosis or remedy report."
    },
    {
      "key": "P12",
      "findings": "@boyauditsskincare, reply to P06, 7-30, 0 likes: bare same agreement. Separately dated contextual arrival-leak assertion; no closure detail, SKU or remedy. Zero likes do not erase the testimony."
    },
    {
      "key": "P13",
      "findings": "@betterxthanxnew, reply to P06, 5-18, 0 likes: ordered from Sephora; top was not properly screwed down and a major leak occurred. Explicit detailed arrival-leak/closure recurrence with P06 within the same thread; SKU/version unknown, no remedy stated."
    },
    {
      "key": "R01",
      "findings": "Junip review 13200181, actor 215817888, published 2026-05-10T02:01:45.837Z, Softwear–Void, version unknown. Reports lid repeatedly unscrewing, a pocket-at-work leak staining underwear/shirt/jeans, inability to return recovered product to the package and substantial loss. Loves Void and explicitly intends repurchase despite cost frustration; suggests click-lock or doe-foot alternatives. Rating 3/5, would recommend true, native verified-buyer flag true, rewarded false; review endorsement engagement unavailable. Product aggregate ratings are not this review’s engagement. Different product/condition from unidentified TikTok arrival reports; recurrent lid loss is one account’s narrative, not an enumerated event count."
    }
  ],
